{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35147","headline":"诗品二十四则 纤穠 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 纤穠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采采流水，蓬蓬远春。\n窈窕深谷，时见美人。\n碧桃满树，风日水滨。\n柳阴路曲，流莺比邻。\n乘之愈往，识之愈真。\n如将不尽，与古爲新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}